WEBVTT

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.817
"I cannot believe you got into Yale."

00:09:01.841 --> 00:09:04.413
And I just turned red,
and the rest of the interview,

00:09:04.437 --> 00:09:06.354
I just felt so horrible.

00:09:06.378 --> 00:09:07.765
AG: Oh, that's awful.

00:09:07.789 --> 00:09:10.490
You know, actually I have a thought
on who might do that.

00:09:10.514 --> 00:09:12.869
Have you seen the recent
evidence on brainteasers

00:09:12.893 --> 00:09:15.051
where they tell us
nothing about candidates,

00:09:15.075 --> 00:09:17.234
but they reveal something
about the managers

00:09:17.258 --> 00:09:18.476
who like to ask them?

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:21.218
It turns out that managers
who love brainteasers

00:09:21.242 --> 00:09:23.023
tend to score high on sadism.

00:09:23.047 --> 00:09:24.346
(Lauren laughs)

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.521
Do you think that was
a sadistic interviewer?

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:31.127
LR: That's one of the funniest
things, it made my day.